# ServiceLoader registration for the OpenCV/JNI enhancer.
#
# Listing a provider here only makes it *discoverable*. ImageEnhancer.discover() still calls
# isAvailable() on it, which returns false when pip_enhance is not loadable -- so shipping this file
# on a machine with no OpenCV is harmless and produces one WARNING line, not a failure.
#
# PassthroughEnhancer is deliberately NOT registered in pip-core's own resources: a test there must be
# able to prove that discovery falls back correctly when the classpath is empty. Its registration
# lives in pip-app, the module that assembles a running application.
com.parallelimage.nativebridge.NativeImageEnhancer
